The following is a requested uuencoded version of ME3.6J.  It is for the
IBM PC only.  It is the same as posted by the original author with only
a few modifications.  One significant item is that it will not come up
in CMODE when editing a file with .C or .H suffixes as I found that 
annoying in my case.  This works on my AT with a PGA, my XT with an EGA,
and my Compaq portable (as shipped from factory).
Standard disclaimers apply.

The source is in two parts.  Remove headers and tails, etc. cat the first
two parts together and run through uudecode.

Part 3 is a list of key bindings.  You may write your own emacs.rc as covered
in the readme of the original ME posting to tailor for your own wishes.



